# Root build context is used by noosphere-remote-mcp-server/Dockerfile, which
# needs the three Remote Project Memory packages (contracts, postgres control
# plane, HTTP server) but nothing else in the monorepo.
**/._*
._*
**/.DS_Store
.DS_Store
# The server Dockerfile copies whole package directories, so an owner-local
# environment file beside one of them would otherwise be baked into the image.
# scripts/docker-build.mjs filters these in code; this covers the direct
# `docker build -f noosphere-remote-mcp-server/Dockerfile .` path deploy.yml uses.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/tests
.git
.github
.noosphere
.claude
.claude-flow
.cursor
.serena
docs
scripts
unused
*.png
*.md
noosphere-acp-protocol
noosphere-mcp
noosphere-local-mcp
noosphere-relayer
noosphere-remote-mcp-acceptance
